in streams foreach is possible with break
answer) No, you cannot use break inside forEach() of a stream.

        Because:

        forEach() takes a lambda

        Lambda is not a loop block

        break and continue only work with real loops (for, while, do-while)

        use short-circuit operators like findfirst or findany and use filter

